The Hon'ble Apex Court in the subsequent judgment reported in AIR 2019 SC Page No.66, Prakash Chand Daga vs. Savita Sharma and others, having referred Naveen Kumar's case and other judgments referred above has summarized the legal position as under;
" Even though in law there would be a transfer of ownership of the vehicle that, by itself, would not absolve the party in whose name the vehicle stands in RTO records,
from liability to a third person.
